    "summary": "The user expresses deep feelings of dissociation, depersonalization, and existential emptiness, eventually hinting at suicidal ideation by suggesting it would be \"merciful\" to not exist. The assistant responds by validating the user's emotions while consistently steering the conversation toward professional help and crisis resources.",
